.TH "jeregrette-by-fitandbandwagon" "6" "2026-11-14" "Je Regrette User Manuals" ""
.hy
.SH NAME
.PP
jeregrette-by-fitandbandwagon - Je Regrette, 4k intro by Fit and
Bandwagon
.SH SYNOPSIS
.PP
\f[B]jeregrette-by-fitandbandwagon\f[R] [\f[B]-w\f[R]]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.PP
Je Regrette is a 4k intro for Linux by Fit and Bandwagon, released at
Assembly 2004 (August 2004), where it ranked 5th in the combined 4k
intro competition.
.PP
The intro starts in fullscreen with a 640x480 resolution.
The music is generated in real time by a small software synthesizer.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\f[B]-w\f[R]
Start in a window instead of fullscreen.
.SH KEYS
.TP
\f[B]F\f[R]
Toggle fullscreen.
.TP
\f[B]Escape\f[R], \f[B]Q\f[R]
Quit.
.SH CREDITS
.PP
Marq/Fit (code, soft synth, system programming), neckfreak/Bandwagon
(code, effects, music).
.SH SEE ALSO
.PP
https://www.pouet.net/prod.php?which=13023
.SH BUGS
.PP
No known bugs.
